doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22012048"
abstract: >-
  The I·V·O Lens Prompt v4.0 is a frozen, domain-independent instrument for
  structural analysis using O (Structured Possibility), V (Instantiated
  Relation), and I (Situated Selectivity) as functional assignments within an
  explicitly stated scope. Version 4.0 strengthens the I-boundary through
  positive-evidence, revocability, remove-and-compare, system-boundary, and
  cross-scale non-cancellation safeguards.
keywords:
  - systems thinking
  - structural analysis
  - structured possibility
  - instantiated relation
  - situated selectivity
  - AI prompting
  - design research
